This licence covers foxanimrip (everything under src/ and tools/).

The Blender add-on under blender/io_foxbrowser/ is GPL-3.0-or-later, because
Blender add-ons link against Blender's GPL Python API. Its licence text is in
blender/io_foxbrowser/LICENSE.

foxanimrip is not affiliated with, and contains no code from, FoxBrowser or
Konami. It reads FoxBrowser's own assemblies out of the copy of FoxBrowser.exe
on the user's machine at run time; none of them are redistributed here.
Metal Gear Solid and Fox Engine are trademarks of Konami.
